%% Description:
%% Token context budget allocation for coding agent sessions.
%% Illustrates how to distribute the active context window across:
%% - System Rules & Boundaries (AGENTS.md, task goals) ~15%
%% - Target Interface & Type Schemas ~25%
%% - Unit & Integration Test Files ~25%
%% - Working Code & Diff Generation Space ~35%
%% And explicit exclusions that must never be loaded into context.

pie title Context Window Budget Allocation (Total ~20k Tokens)
    "System Rules & Task Goals (AGENTS.md)" : 15
    "Target Schemas & Type Interfaces" : 25
    "Active Test Suite & Fixtures" : 25
    "Working Code & Diff Space" : 35

%% Explicit Exclusions from Context:
%% - node_modules / lockfiles
%% - Large binary assets / coverage reports
